<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective March 13-19:</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 56.51</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 60.18</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 61.88</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 64.99</p>
<p>    Cocoa butter...............................$156.28</p>
<p>    Residual butter............................$117.21</p>
<p>    Unsweeten or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>    Cocoa liquor or paste......................$ 82.74</p>
<p>    Cocoa cake.................................$ 20.83</p>
<p>    Residual natural cake......................$  2.08</p>
<p>    Cocoa powder...............................$ 23.09</p>
</text>
